[[Jokoul]] used Strikemode on his [[Jokoul]]. This version had a violet aura instead of the usual red aura. {{source|SAS-125}}

[[Klaus]] used the spell to power up [[Brahe]]'s offensive abilities. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

Klaus later used his engineering abilities to improve the spell into [[Overmode]]. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

